#: ../../language/attributes/cfg.md:1
msgid "Configuration attribute"
msgstr "`cfg` 属性"

#: ../../language/attributes/cfg.md:3
msgid ""
"The `#cfg` attribute controls whether a declaration is included in "
"compilation. Conditions are evaluated at compile time and can use:"
msgstr "`#cfg` 属性控制某个声明是否参与编译。条件在编译时求值，可以使用："

#: ../../language/attributes/cfg.md:6
msgid "`true` or `false` to always include or exclude a declaration."
msgstr "`true` 或 `false`：始终包含或排除某个声明。"

#: ../../language/attributes/cfg.md:7
msgid "`target` to select a compilation backend, such as `target=\"wasm\"`."
msgstr "`target`：选择编译后端，例如 `target=\"wasm\"`。"

#: ../../language/attributes/cfg.md:8
msgid "`platform` to select an operating system, such as `platform=\"windows\"`."
msgstr "`platform`：选择操作系统，例如 `platform=\"windows\"`。"

#: ../../language/attributes/cfg.md:9
msgid ""
"`not(...)`, `all(...)`, or `any(...)` to negate a condition, require all "
"conditions, or require at least one condition."
msgstr "`not(...)`、`all(...)` 或 `any(...)`：分别表示条件取反、所有条件均成立或至少一个条件成立。"

#: ../../language/attributes/cfg.md:12
msgid ""
"For example, `not(platform=\"windows\")` includes a declaration on non-"
"Windows platforms, while `all(target=\"native\", platform=\"windows\")` "
"includes it only for the native backend on Windows."
msgstr "例如，`not(platform=\"windows\")` 在非 Windows 平台上包含声明，而 `all(target=\"native\", platform=\"windows\")` 仅在 Windows 上使用 native 后端时包含声明。"

#: ../../language/attributes/cfg.md:18
msgid ""
"#cfg(true)\n"
"fn cfg_true() -> Unit {\n"
"  ()\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"#cfg(false)\n"
"fn cfg_false() -> Unit {\n"
"  ()\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"#cfg(target=\"wasm\")\n"
"fn cfg_wasm() -> Unit {\n"
"  ()\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"#cfg(platform=\"windows\")\n"
"fn cfg_windows() -> Unit {\n"
"  ()\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"#cfg(not(platform=\"windows\"))\n"
"fn cfg_non_windows() -> Unit {\n"
"  ()\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"#cfg(all(target=\"native\", platform=\"windows\"))\n"
"fn cfg_all() -> Unit {\n"
"  ()\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"#cfg(any(target=\"wasm\", target=\"native\"))\n"
"fn cfg_any() -> Unit {\n"
"  ()\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
